# Files that must never reach the image.
#
# `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile is deliberately broad, which makes this list the
# only thing standing between the build context and the registry. Two of these
# matter for more than image size: the SQLite file holds real plate-to-location
# history, and a local `.env` holds the write key.

# Local virtualenvs — often built for a different OS, always huge.
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Runtime database: plate reads, journeys, violations. Not build input.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Secrets. ANPR_API_KEY and datastore passwords are injected at run time.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build/test detritus.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Editor and VCS noise.
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
